# misc
*.tsbuildinfo
# Anchored to package roots (test-coverage output), not a bare "coverage/" glob — that
# silently swallowed app/roster/coverage/ (a real Next.js route, not test output) until
# D3 caught it (roster weekly coverage board increment).
apps/*/coverage/
packages/*/coverage/
next-env.d.ts
